Not working off my own memory, but I think that would be Jay Kominek, who announced 
a wiki <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/lojban/_3V3gX4vsko/868ezUxQbfcJ> in 
June 2001, and stepped down from running it  
<https://groups.google.com/d/msg/lojban/RX19XdqUbKc/OvjDFYGboqYJ>in 
November 2002. The Internet Archive imaged its home page 
<http://web.archive.org/web/20030207203219/http://nuzban.wiw.org/wiki/> as 
late as February 2003, as well as the directory where the backups were 
posted 
<http://web.archive.org/web/20030117200248/http://nuzban.wiw.org/wiki/backup/>, 
but the backup files themselves don't appear to be in the archive, and the 
directory is long gone.

mi'e la mukti mu'o

